# EcoSuit MK.I — Chest plates + chest harness
**Full shop process: plastron sandwich plates, sternum cup, chest harness spider, mate to HUT / dorsal pack**
Paper traveler. Not a method to build a horizon or an FTL drive.
Chest hardware mounts ABH-2600-SM only. Load path is lattice, not ceramic.

---

## 0. What you are building

Three LRUs that become one chest article:

| LRU | Name | Job |
|---|---|---|
| PLT-CHEST | Faceted ceramic / hemp sandwich set (plastron + collateral scales) | OML, heat, MMOD, Iron Man read |
| CUP-SM | Sternum cup + cap (ABH-2600-SM) | Shielded 118 mm module bore |
| HARN-CH | Chest harness spider + strap-and-longerons | Carries plates and cup into the HUT; ties to FTL-BH-1 / DSH-1 at the hatch ring |

Worn stack through the sternum (outside → in):
CER face → densified IML → flexible adhesive → hemp core → backing + Ti / S-glass doubler → HUT shell → harness spider → cup → LCVG stand-off.

Hemp stops at the sealed cup land. Bolts never enter ceramic or core.

