## 2. Materials kit (chest only)

Pull from the master materials list. Minimum kit for one chest:

**Plates**
- CER-B blanks (black HRSI analog) sized + grind stock
- CER-D densify slurry, CER-WP overcoat
- HEMP-W, HEMP-U, HEMP-M from a baked CORE-LOT
- MAT-P (PI or phenolic). MAT-E epoxy = ground demo only
- ADH-F flexible adhesive (0.15–0.25 mm)
- SEAL-PI edge-seal system
- BK-SG backing; DBL-TI or DBL-SG doubler; INS-TI inserts
- Peel ply, bag kit, cauls

**Cup + harness**
- CUP-CU liner (OFHC Cu or TZM)
- CUP-TI or CUP-IN wall
- CUP-SG wrap, CUP-W aft (crew-side) only
- CAP-S ceramic-faced cap
- EXO-IN or EXO-TI spider
- FAST-A286 / Ti M8 captives (S1–S4), PIN-17 dowel
- DSH interface brackets (upper two toward hatch ring)
- COOL-A/B 4 mm stainless + QDs, DSH-HP heat-pipe stub
- PWR-1 / TM connectors, dead-face half
- Optional V-EBM pair for the cap latch (vacuum-side only)

Reject: VHB, carbon grease, hemp inside the cup, bolt-through-ceramic hardware, any tube stamped “to Rs.”

